nelius reaches under the podium.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody speaks.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "The lights go out.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "When they come back, the case is empty, the podium is empty, and the three glasses lie upside down on the cloth in a perfect row.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}